{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.CyclotomicDilogCollapse","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.CyclotomicDilogCollapse","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.RootsOfUnity.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Polynomial.Cyclotomic.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.CyclotomicDilogCollapse.cyclotomic_collapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.CyclotomicDilogCollapse.cyclotomic_collapse","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/CyclotomicDilogCollapse.lean#L30-L74","doc":"**Cyclotomic collapse.** Over a field `K`, if `ζ` is a primitive `N`-th\nroot of unity (`N > 0`), then for every `x : K`,\n`∏_{k=0}^{N-1} (1 - x·ζ^k) = 1 - x^N`.\n\nThis is the finite root-of-unity reduction of the q-Pochhammer denominator\n`(x; q)_N` at `q = ζ_N`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}